                "format": 0,
                "style": "",
                "mode": "normal",
                "detail": 0,
                "text": "Trainzilla issues invoices for the payments your clients make to you and keeps records you can export. It does not file returns or give tax advice — GST registration and filing depend on your turnover and setup, so check with a CA. If you are GST-registered, add your GSTIN and rate so it appears on invoices.",
                "version": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr",
        "format": "",
        "indent": 0,
        "version": 1
      }
    },
